---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout 
  title="Floral Art & Flower Arranging | Kim Baillie"
  description="Floral design, competition masterclasses, and floral art demonstration techniques by Kim Baillie. Creator of Floral Art Online."
  ogImage="/images/floral-art.jpg"
>
  <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
    <a href="/">Home</a>
    <span class="separator">&rsaquo;</span>
    <span aria-current="page">Floral Art</span>
  </nav>

  <article class="content-box">
    <h1>Floral Art & Flower Arranging</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      Floral design—art with flowers—has been my passion for over 25 years. Combining architectural structure, botanical textures, and spatial balance, floral art is an extraordinary creative outlet that bridges nature and sculpture.
    </p>

    <div style="margin: 2rem 0; text-align: center;">
      <img src="/images/floral-art.jpg" alt="Floral Art by Kim Baillie" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: var(--shadow);" />
    </div>

    <p>
      Over the decades, I have competed, judged, and demonstrated at premier floral design competitions nationally and internationally. Recognizing that many passionate designers cannot attend regular club meetings or specialized workshops, I created online platforms to share designs, video walkthroughs, and technical advice worldwide:
    </p>

    <ul>
      <li><strong>Floral Art Online:</strong> Step-by-step masterclasses, design principles, container mechanics, and demonstration tutorials.</li>
      <li><strong>Floral Art Review:</strong> Reviews, contest critiques, and international competition showcases.</li>
    </ul>

    <div style="background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; padding: 2rem; margin-top: 2.5rem; text-align: center;">
      <h2 style="margin-top: 0; font-family: var(--font-serif); color: var(--text-dark);">Explore Floral Art Online</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--text-muted); max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto 1.5rem auto;">
        Discover video tutorials, creative design showcases, and demonstration advice for floral designers of all experience levels.
      </p>
      <a href="https://floralartonline.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn" style="max-width: 320px; margin: 0 auto;">
        Visit FloralArtOnline.com &rarr;
      </a>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
